{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，公如齊。公至自齊。齊人歸我濟西田。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"齊已取之矣，其言我何？言我者未絕於我也。曷為未絕于我？齊已言取之矣，其實未之齊也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"二、夏四月丙辰，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"三、己巳，齊侯元卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"四、齊崔氏出奔衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"崔氏者何？齊大夫也。其稱崔氏何？貶。曷為貶？譏世卿，世卿非禮也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"五、公如齊。五月，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"六、癸巳，陳夏徵舒弒其君平國。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"七、六月，宋師伐滕。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"八、公孫歸父如齊，葬齊惠公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"九、晉人、宋人、衞人、曹人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十、秋，天王使王季子來聘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"王季子者何？天子之大夫也。其稱王季子何？貴也。其貴奈何？母弟也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十一、公孫歸父帥師伐邾婁，取蘱。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十二、大水。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十三、季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十四、冬，公孫歸父如齊。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十五、齊侯使國佐來聘。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_19","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十六、饑。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_20","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"何以書？以重書也。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_cdt_124_21","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_124","textTraditional":"十七、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":21}],"overrides":{}}